{"title": "[情報] 世界賽主題曲True Damage <Know My Name>", "author": "rainnawind (正太學研究者雨颯)", "board": "", "date": "Fri Oct  9 08:53:38 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/LoL/M.1791507220.A.BCD.html", "body": "9點整首播，傳送門 →\nhttps://youtu.be/mlFxxNsExJc\n\n〈Know My Name〉合作演出：真傷樂團(官方MV)｜《英雄聯盟》2026世界大賽主題曲\n\n真傷樂團在這支全新MV中留下鮮明印記，帶來2026世界大賽官方主題曲〈Know My Name〉\n\n歌曲邀請i-dle的SOYEON、Coco Jones、Vic Mensa與Sofía Reyes獻聲。\n\n“Coming out to the venue today, I had a brief moment thinking back to 2017.\n  But once the game started, how I felt was completely different from back\n  in 2017.\n  Win or lose, I remained completely locked into the game, and it really hit\n  me how much I’ve matured.\n\n  I think I’ve completely moved past the pain of that 2017 loss.\n  Those past experiences have helped me immensely, and I feel really proud of\n  the progress I’ve made.”\n— Lee \"Faker\" Sang-hyeok, after his 6th Worlds win\n\n「今天來到賽場時，我有短暫回想起 2017 年。\n  但當比賽一開始，我就感覺到和 2017 年時完全不同了。\n  不管贏或是輸，我都讓自己全神貫注在比賽上，這會我感覺到自己已經有多成熟。\n\n  我覺得自己已經徹底走過了 2017 年落敗時的痛苦。\n  那些過去的經歷給了我非常大的幫助，我真的為我達成的進步感到驕傲。」\n\n—— 「Faker」李相赫，第 6 次贏得世界大賽冠軍後的談話", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "LightEcho", "content": "先推", "time": "10/09 08:54"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "d6102003", "content": "來了", "time": "10/09 08:56"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "qd6590", "content": "來", "time": "10/09 08:57"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "q1a2z3w0", "content": "期待", "time": "10/09 08:58"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "rainnawind", "content": "串流待機的人快2萬5了", "time": "10/09 08:58"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Meowcc", "content": "來了 這首不知道會不會成為小娟今年第二首爆曲", "time": "10/09 08:59"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "rainnawind", "content": "一分鐘內飆到3萬了", "time": "10/09 08:59"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "RushMonkey", "content": "來囉", "time": "10/09 09:00"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "waiting101", "content": "有老skt t1", "time": "10/09 09:01"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Meowcc", "content": "竟然有嘟尼", "time": "10/09 09:02"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "RushMonkey", "content": "小K爆哭也放進去惹", "time": "10/09 09:02"}, {"